<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF COLLATED THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF COLLATED THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated</p>
