<p>423 Scotland (Andrew Coltart 70 72 72, Paul Lawrie 69 70 70)</p>
<p>426 United States (Tom Lehman 73 70 70, Steve Jones 73 70 70)</p>
<p>429 Germany  (Bernhard Langer 71 68 72, Alexander Cejka 74 76</p>
